al Gateway `MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` on port `8001`) with multi-format support (`.xlsx`, `.md`, `.pdf`), isolated per-process caching and resume capabilities, while preserving the matching and classification engine intact.\n- **Recent User Issue**:\n  1. The user ran `python desktop_app\\app.py` in `Pharmacy-agy-vision`. Shortages (`0913.xlsx`, 993 items) extracted cleanly. But when processing 6 warehouse PDFs (`السلام شبين.pdf`, `المكرومي المنصورة.pdf`, `الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf`, `جملة العمروووو.pdf`, `كيور فارما خاص.pdf`, `مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.pdf`), 5 of the 6 threw:\n     `HTTP Error 429: {\"detail\":{\"error\":\"Server busy — browser tab currently processing another request.\",\"type\":\"concurrency_limit\"}}`\n     Only `جملة العمروووو.pdf` succeeded (10 items). Then the user stopped the server mid-run, causing connection aborted errors.\n  2. UI bug: `#progress-modal` was covering the entire application across all screens (Settings, Terminal, History), rather than being scoped to the \"New Match\" screen.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed:\n1. **Isolated Version Created**:\n   - Cloned `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` $\\rightarrow$ `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision`.\n   - The original `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy` is 100% untouched.\n2. **Multi-Format Ingestion**:\n   - `src/extract/markdown_reader.py`: Built parser for tables and lists.\n   - `src/extract/excel_reader.py`: Enhanced auto-detection of drug name columns and sheets.\n   - `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`: Built page-by-page WebP rendering (`scale=2.5`), isolated caching in `data/processes/PROC-XXX/cache/vision/<file_slug>_<hash[:10]>/`, and `manifest.json` for automatic resumption.\n3. **Concurrency Fix (Resolution of HTTP 429 Concurrency Limit)**:\n   - **Root Cause**: `src/extract/file_handler.py` ran `ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=6)` against a single Google AI Studio browser tab. The tab can only process one prompt/image at a time.\n   - **Fix Applied**:\n     - In `src/extract/file_handler.py`: Switched `read_input_files` to a sequential queue (`for idx, fp in enumerate(filepaths)`).\n     - In `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`: Added global `_GATEWAY_MUTEX = threading.Lock()` around gateway requests.\n     - Added HTTP 429 handling with polite 5s backoff and increased `max_retries` from 3 to 10.\n4. **UI Scope & Navigation Fix**:\n   - In `desktop_app/templates/index.html`: Moved `#progress-modal` directly inside `<div id=\"screen-new\" class=\"screen active\">`.\n   - Scoped `#progress-modal` CSS (`position: absolute; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);`). When navigating to Terminal, Servers, Settings, or History, `#progress-modal` is hidden with `screen-new`, leaving other screens 100% clear.\n   - Added `#top-bar-process-badge` in the top bar (`⏳ عملية قيد التشغيل...`) with click-to-return to `screen-new`.\n   - Fixed `showScreen` sidebar synchronization bug.\n5. **Launcher Scripts**:\n   - `run.bat` and `run_conda.bat` updated to directly prioritize Conda Python `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe` / `pythonw.exe`.\n6. **Documentation**:\n   - `SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE_GRAPH.md` in `Pharmacy-agy-vision` updated with new Mermaid diagrams for the Vision pipeline, multi-format ingestion, and caching lifecycle.\n   - `walkthrough.md` updated in artifacts directory.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Key Findings & Diagnoses\n1. **Google AI Studio Browser Tab Concurrency**:\n   - The Vision Gateway (`MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` on port 8001) operates via Playwright controlling a single AI Studio tab.\n   - Multiple parallel requests to `http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions` immediately trigger `HTTP 429 concurrency_limit`.\n   - **Rule**: All Vision PDF requests must be serialized (processed sequentially).\n2. **Prompt and Image Delivery Verification**:\n   - The user asked: *\"وأنا بتابع المتصفح، هو بيوصله الـ prompt والصورة؟\"*\n   - **Answer**: Yes, 100%! In the user's terminal log, `جملة العمروووو.pdf` reached the tab, tokenized, and extracted 10 items in 18.1s. The other 5 failed only because they fired concurrently at the same millisecond and timed out on 429. With the sequential fix now applied, each PDF will be processed one by one without any 429 errors.\n3. **Cache Isolation**:\n   - The user asked if it read old cache: No, it created clean isolated folders under `data/processes/PROC-017/cache/vision/` and rendered WebP images for all pages.\n4. **Mid-run Server Shutdown**:\n   - The `ConnectionResetError` / `[WinError 10061]` was caused solely because the user manually killed the server while `FastCoordinator` was attempting to call the local LLM.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- **Project Directory**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision`\n- **Conda Environment**: `D:\\miniconda3\\envs\\venv\\python.exe`\n- **Vision Server**: `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` (Port 8001, model `gemini-3.8-flash`).\n- **Current State of Codebase**:\n  - `src/extract/file_handler.py`: Updated to sequential execution.\n  - `src/extract/gemini_vision_extractor.py`: Equipped with `_GATEWAY_MUTEX`, HTTP 429 retry backoff, and `max_retries=10`.\n  - `desktop_app/templates/index.html`: `#progress-modal` moved inside `#screen-new`; top bar process badge added; sidebar sync fixed.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Explain the Diagnosis to the User**:\n   - Reassure the user that the prompt and image **did** reach the browser (as evidenced by `جملة العمروووو.pdf` completing in 18.1s).\n   - Explain why the other 5 PDFs failed (parallel workers colliding on a single browser tab -> HTTP 429).\n   - Inform the user that both the sequential queue fix and the UI `#progress-modal` scoping fix have been implemented in `Pharmacy-agy-vision`.\n2. **Guide the User to Run/Test**:\n   - Start the Vision Server (`MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision` on port 8001) either via the Desktop App's \"إدارة السيرفرات\" or by running `python app.py` in `D:\\AI_Engineer\\MSEMAX-GAIStudio-vision`.\n   - Run the app via `run_conda.bat`